#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/server/major/proftpd.xml:95
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of ProFTPD"
msgstr "Instalação do ProFTPD"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/proftpd.xml:98
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"For security reasons, you should install <application>ProFTPD</application> "
"using an unprivileged user and group.  As the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Por motivos de segurança, você deveria instalar o "
"&quot;<application>ProFTPD</application>&quot; usando um(a) usuário(a) e "
"grupo sem privilégios. Como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/proftpd.xml:103
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>groupadd -g 46 proftpd                             &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd -c proftpd -d /srv/ftp -g proftpd \\\n"
"        -s /usr/bin/proftpdshell -u 46 proftpd     &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -d -m775 -o proftpd -g proftpd /srv/ftp &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -v -s /usr/bin/false /usr/bin/proftpdshell      &amp;&amp;\n"
"echo /usr/bin/proftpdshell &gt;&gt; /etc/shells</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>groupadd -g 46 proftpd                            &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd -c proftpd -d /srv/ftp -g proftpd \\\n"
"        -s /usr/bin/proftpdshell -u 46 proftpd     &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -d -m775 -o proftpd -g proftpd /srv/ftp &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -v -s /usr/bin/false /usr/bin/proftpdshell      &amp;&amp;\n"
"echo /usr/bin/proftpdshell &gt;&gt; /etc/shells</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/proftpd.xml:119
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>ProFTPD</application> as an unprivileged user by "
"running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>ProFTPD</application>&quot; como um(a) "
"usuário(a) sem privilégios executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/proftpd.xml:123
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr --sysconfdir=/etc --localstatedir=/run &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr --sysconfdir=/etc --localstatedir=/run &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/proftpd.xml:127
#, xml-text
msgid "This packages does not come with a usable test suite."
msgstr "Esses pacotes não vem com uma suíte de teste usável."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/proftpd.xml:131
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/proftpd.xml:134
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install                                   &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -d -m755 /usr/share/doc/proftpd-&proftpd-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -Rv doc/*     /usr/share/doc/proftpd-&proftpd-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install                                   &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -d -m755 /usr/share/doc/proftpd-&proftpd-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -Rv doc/*     /usr/share/doc/proftpd-&proftpd-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/server/major/proftpd.xml:141
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/proftpd.xml:144
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>install -v -d -m775 -o proftpd -g proftpd /srv/ftp</command>: "
"Create the home directory for <application>ProFTPD</application>."
msgstr ""
"<command>install -v -d -m775 -o proftpd -g proftpd /srv/ftp</command>: Crie "
"o diretório lar para o &quot;<application>ProFTPD</application>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/proftpd.xml:149
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>ln -v -s /usr/bin/false /usr/bin/proftpdshell</command>: Set the "
"default shell as a link to an invalid shell."
msgstr ""
"<command>ln -v -s /usr/bin/false /usr/bin/proftpdshell</command>: Configure "
"o &quot;shell&quot; padrão como um link para um &quot;shell&quot; inválido."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/proftpd.xml:154
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>echo /usr/bin/proftpdshell &gt;&gt; /etc/shells</command>: Fake a "
"valid shell for compatibility purposes."
msgstr ""
"<command>echo /usr/bin/proftpdshell &gt;&gt; /etc/shells</command>: "
"Falsifique um &quot;shell&quot; válido para fins de compatibilidade."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/proftpd.xml:160
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The above two commands can be omitted if the following directive is placed "
"in the configuration file:"
msgstr ""
"Os dois comandos acima podem ser omitidos se a seguinte diretiva for "
"colocada no arquivo de configuração:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/proftpd.xml:164
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<literal>RequireValidShell off</literal>"
msgstr "<literal>RequireValidShell off</literal>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/proftpd.xml:167
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"By default, proftpd will require that users logging in have valid shells. "
"The RequireValidShell directive turns off this requirement.  This is only "
"recommended if you are setting up your FTP server exclusively for anonymous "
"downloads."
msgstr ""
"Por padrão, o &quot;proftpd&quot; exigirá que os(as) usuários(as) se logando"
" tenham &quot;shells&quot; válidos. A diretiva &quot;RequireValidShell&quot;"
" desliga esse requisito. Isso é recomendado somente se você estiver "
"configurando o teu servidor &quot;FTP&quot; exclusivamente para "
"transferências anônimas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/proftpd.xml:176
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Support for most of the dependency packages requires using options passed to"
" the <command>configure</command> script. View the output from "
"<command>./configure --help</command> for complete information about "
"enabling dependency packages."
msgstr ""
"O suporte para a maioria dos pacotes de dependências exige usar opções "
"passadas para o conjunto de comandos sequenciais "
"<command>configure</command>. Veja-se a saída gerada a partir de "
"<command>./configure --help</command> para informações completas relativas a"
" habilitar pacotes de dependências."

